# A small hand-written session. Prices in ticks, quantities in lots.
# Build a book: two bid levels, two ask levels.
N 1 B LMT 9990 10
N 2 B LMT 9990 5
N 3 B LMT 9980 20
N 4 S LMT 10010 10
N 5 S LMT 10020 15
# Post-only that would cross is rejected; one that does not cross rests.
N 6 B POST 10010 5
N 7 B POST 10000 5
# Aggressive limit takes all of 10010 and 2 lots of 10020.
N 8 B LMT 10020 12
# IOC for more than is available at its limit: partial fill, rest cancelled.
N 9 S IOC 10000 8
# FOK that cannot fill completely is cancelled with no trades.
N 10 S FOK 9990 100
# Modify down keeps priority, modify up loses it.
M 1 9990 4
M 2 9990 9
# Market sell sweeps the bids.
N 11 S MKT 0 12
C 3
C 3
